と…？","nextNodeIds":[733300710]},{"nodeId":733300710,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20966,"speakerName":"マルコゾフ","textMapHash":3157618722,"text":"いえ、私が言いたいのはですね…いかに君だろうと、今の状態は…いささか贅沢がすぎるんじゃないかということです。","nextNodeIds":[733300711]},{"nodeId":733300711,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20966,"speakerName":"マルコゾフ","textMapHash":2747292186,"text":"不公平ではありませんか…ですからここはひとつ、花霊を私に譲ってはいただけないでしょうか。花霊への待遇については、その役割を全うさせますから、どうかご心配なく。","nextNodeIds":[733300712]},{"nodeId":733300712,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20883,"speakerName":"ソルシュ","textMapHash":2685451146,"text":"無礼者…","nextNodeIds":[733300713]},{"nodeId":733300713,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3118738746,"text":"なんて理不尽なやつだ、全然話が通じないじゃないか！","nextNodeIds":[733300714]},{"nodeId":733300714,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20883,"speakerName":"ソルシュ","textMapHash":3892064834,"text":"世の中には会話よりも効果的な手段があるワ…聡明なる我が「謁賛主」なら、私の言っている意味が分かるデショ？","nextNodeIds":[733300715]},{"nodeId":733300715,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2786176930,"text":"つまり、あいつをボコボコにしてやろう、ってことだな！","nextNodeIds":[733300716]},{"nodeId":733300716,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20883,"speakerName":"ソルシュ","textMapHash":3478280506,"text":"フン、白フラは引っ込んデ！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":733300708,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1454066146,"text":"仲間が増えるのは歓迎だ。","nextNodeIds":[733300709]},{"nodeId":733300709,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":958504018,"text":"そんなのあり得ないぞ！ぜーったいダメだ、おまえの「最高の仲間」はオイラだけだぞ！","nextNodeIds":[733300710]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7333007,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_L